!===============================================================================
! NOT AVAILABLE: MMPPE protocol variables with no native CESM/CAM6 (MG2/MAM4)
! history field and no reasonable post-processing derivation from existing
! output (per MMPPE-info/6hourly_variable_mapping.txt and
! monthly_mean_variable_mapping.txt's "NONE-BEST" entries with no formula
! given). Deliberately NOT in any fincl list above -- listed here so nothing
! is silently dropped. Each would need either new Fortran diagnostic code or
! an offline calculation not implemented anywhere in this codebase.
!
!   N70, N100         -- size-thresholded (>70/100nm diameter) surface number
!                        concentration; no size-binned diagnostic exists.
!   PM1, PM10         -- only a 2.5um cutoff (PM25_SRF) is implemented.
!   LTS               -- lower tropospheric stability; not output anywhere,
!                        would be a purely offline calc from T(700hPa)/TS.
!   CTT               -- warm cloud-top temperature; no cloud-top-temperature
!                        field exists at all (do not substitute TREFHT).
!   dzhalf            -- layer thickness; derive from Z3 differences or
!                        hyai/hybi (not a history field) instead.
!   rho               -- air density; derive from PMID/(Rd*Tv) using T,Q.
!   dew2              -- 2m dewpoint; derive from TREFHT/Q2m/PS offline.
!   emi_bb_so2/bc/oc  -- no field isolates the biomass-burning-only fraction
!                        of SFSO2/SFbc_a4/SFpom_a4 (those are combined
!                        anthro+bb totals); would need new outfld splitting
!                        in mo_srf_emissions.F90, or a bb-scale=0 sensitivity
!                        run diffed against control.
!   ABS_COMP_OC/SO4/DU/SS/WAT_550nm -- CAM only decomposes absorption OD by
!                        species for BC (AODABSBC); no equivalent exists for
!                        the other species.
!   TAU_COMP_WAT_550nm -- no water-specific AOD component field.
!   TAU_2D_MODE_{KS,AS,CS,KI,AI,CI}_550nm,
!   ABS_2D_MODE_{KS,AS,CS,KI,AI,CI}_550nm -- MAM4 has no soluble/insoluble
!                        mode split (ECHAM-HAM-specific mode structure); the
!                        per-SPECIES AOD fields (AODDUST/AODSO4/etc., already
!                        in fincl1/fincl3) are the nearest available proxy.
!===============================================================================
